---
---

<section class='intro-field relative min-h-[calc(100svh-10rem)] flex flex-col justify-center mb-8'>
  <div class='mb-6'>
    <h1
      class='font-bold text-center text-4xl md:text-6xl pt-4 pb-2 overflow-hidden tracking-tight'
    >
      <strong class='intro-mark intro-name'>@vdloc</strong>
    </h1>
  </div>
  <div class='space-y-3 mt-8 max-w-xl mx-auto text-center'>
    <h2 class='intro-fade intro-role font-semibold text-lg md:text-xl'>
      Frontend Developer — Ha Noi, Vietnam
    </h2>

    <p class='intro-fade intro-fade-1 intro-body'>
      My name is <strong>Loc</strong> ("Lộc"). It means "green leaf" or "lucky" in
      English.
    </p>

    <p class='intro-fade intro-fade-2 intro-body'>
      I build the artifact, not just describe it — clean, minimalist web
      experiences engineered in <strong>HTML</strong>, <strong>CSS</strong>,
      <strong>JavaScript</strong>, and <strong>React</strong>. The field
      behind this text is live: a GPU cellular automaton, running now, not a
      recording. Explore the work, or get in touch.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class='scroll-cue absolute bottom-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2' aria-hidden='true'>
    <svg width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='none'>
      <path d='M4 7l6 6 6-6' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' />
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro-field {
    color: rgb(226 232 240);
    /* geometric-mono, per OWN-WORLD (direction e3870b1b) — system stack,
       scoped to this Experience surface only, no new webfont asset */
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'JetBrains Mono', 'Space Mono', Menlo,
      Consolas, monospace;
  }

  .intro-name {
    color: rgb(226 232 240);
  }

  .intro-role {
    color: rgb(203 213 225);
  }

  .scroll-cue {
    color: rgb(148 163 184);
    animation: intro-fade-up 500ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 740ms both,
      scroll-cue-bounce 1800ms ease-in-out 1240ms infinite;
  }

  @keyframes scroll-cue-bounce {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(-50%, 0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(-50%, 6px);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .scroll-cue {
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  .intro-body {
    color: rgb(203 213 225);
  }

  .intro-body strong {
    color: rgb(226 232 240);
  }

  @keyframes intro-mark-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      filter: blur(6px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      filter: blur(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes intro-fade-up {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .intro-mark {
    animation: intro-mark-in 700ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 100ms both;
  }

  .intro-fade {
    animation: intro-fade-up 500ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 500ms both;
  }

  .intro-fade-1 {
    animation-delay: 620ms;
  }

  .intro-fade-2 {
    animation-delay: 740ms;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .intro-mark,
    .intro-fade,
    .intro-fade-1,
    .intro-fade-2 {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
      filter: none;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
